WEBVTT

00:00:01.660 --> 00:00:03.860
The Karasumori Site is still
full of secrets.

00:00:04.300 --> 00:00:06.740
But the enormous power of the land

00:00:06.740 --> 00:00:09.670
is sought after by
a mysterious organization.

00:00:12.340 --> 00:00:14.840
An Ayakashi wearing what
seems like human skin

00:00:14.840 --> 00:00:16.240
appears before them.

00:00:17.650 --> 00:00:19.550
While they are on guard,

00:00:19.550 --> 00:00:22.310
they discover the name
of the organization.

00:00:23.650 --> 00:00:25.410
Kokuboro.

00:00:26.050 --> 00:00:28.420
Koku... boro?

00:00:29.520 --> 00:00:31.490
Events are underway,

00:00:31.530 --> 00:00:36.050
that will transcend
Yoshimori and the others' imaginations.

00:00:37.500 --> 00:00:42.770
The dangerous forest invites me
It's showtime again tonight

00:00:42.770 --> 00:00:44.640
(Ayakashi NIGHT)

00:00:44.640 --> 00:00:49.840
Everyone's rampaging
with all their strength

00:00:49.840 --> 00:00:51.740
(Fighting late into the night)

00:00:52.250 --> 00:00:55.180
Drive away all hesitation

00:00:55.180 --> 00:00:59.590
Wanna take them on? Yeah

00:00:59.750 --> 00:01:03.120
I will protect you
(No matter what)

00:01:03.120 --> 00:01:06.460
I will protect you that's all
(that's all I want)

00:01:06.460 --> 00:01:12.130
Goodbye to the days
when all I'd do was cry

00:01:14.440 --> 00:01:16.630
Sha la la la la...

00:01:17.970 --> 00:01:23.040
I hold words in my heart
that I'd like to say

00:01:23.040 --> 00:01:25.010
(Secret romance)

00:01:25.010 --> 00:01:30.220
Standing in front of me is someone
I don't want to lose

00:01:30.220 --> 00:01:31.980
(A strange distance)

00:01:32.450 --> 00:01:38.830
I can't stand watching
people get hurt anymore

00:01:38.890 --> 00:01:39.890
Yeah

00:01:39.890 --> 00:01:43.360
I wanna be your knight
(I wanna be strong)

00:01:43.360 --> 00:01:46.970
I wanna be your light
(More than I am now)

00:01:46.970 --> 00:01:52.300
Someday I'll share with you
my 100% smile

00:02:15.560 --> 00:02:17.900
I will be direct.
We don't have anymore time.

00:02:18.430 --> 00:02:21.490
The Princess does not have
long to live at this rate.

00:02:22.500 --> 00:02:23.770
I'm sure you all know,

00:02:23.770 --> 00:02:26.000
but this castle cannot be
sustained without the Princess.

00:02:26.610 --> 00:02:29.540
You can assume that the powers
of this land are weakening as well.

00:02:29.880 --> 00:02:34.080
Aihi, how is the development
of the new human skin?

00:02:34.750 --> 00:02:36.750
It will still take time

00:02:36.750 --> 00:02:38.580
but I'm in the middle
of the final adjustments.

00:02:39.050 --> 00:02:40.890
What's that new model
you're talking about?

00:02:40.890 --> 00:02:42.620
You can't use the previous one?

00:02:43.020 --> 00:02:44.010
It's an improved version.

00:02:44.290 --> 00:02:46.920
It will allow our soldiers
to look human much longer.

00:02:47.660 --> 00:02:51.360
Too slow!
I'm itching to fight now!

00:02:51.930 --> 00:02:57.000
We should just attack instead of
talking about pointless things here!

00:02:57.310 --> 00:03:01.340
You brain dead simpleton.
Use your head.

00:03:01.340 --> 00:03:02.470
What was that?!

00:03:03.080 --> 00:03:05.550
Hey! Your horns are coming out.

00:03:05.810 --> 00:03:06.950
If you do everything by force,

00:03:06.950 --> 00:03:09.820
you're no different
from other Ayakashi.

00:03:09.850 --> 00:03:12.510
There's more than one way
to conquer that land.

00:03:13.150 --> 00:03:15.380
You can occupy it at night,
but not during the day.

00:03:15.920 --> 00:03:17.920
We cannot move during the day.

00:03:18.960 --> 00:03:21.260
We can think about that
after we take it over.

00:03:21.600 --> 00:03:24.190
Even if we obtain Karasumori now.

00:03:24.230 --> 00:03:27.900
we don't know the most effective way
to utilize its powers.

00:03:28.400 --> 00:03:31.740
There are still many things
we don't know about Karasumori.

00:03:31.940 --> 00:03:34.480
This is stupid!
When can we move?!

00:03:34.480 --> 00:03:35.910
First of all. we must finish the skin.

00:03:36.310 --> 00:03:38.640
Aihi, you need to hurry.

00:03:38.810 --> 00:03:39.800
Understood.

00:03:40.350 --> 00:03:42.610
The Princess does not
have long.

00:03:59.900 --> 00:04:01.300
All right!

00:04:03.610 --> 00:04:05.570
You seem really energetic.

00:04:05.710 --> 00:04:07.770
You're going to crash and burn later
if you go all out early on.

00:04:08.110 --> 00:04:11.040
Shut up! I've gotta give it my all!

00:04:11.280 --> 00:04:13.980
You never know when that
Kokuboro will be attacking!

00:04:14.150 --> 00:04:18.190
It's good that you're motivated.
Isn't it terrible though?

00:04:18.190 --> 00:04:19.190
What is?

00:04:19.190 --> 00:04:20.480
Take a look.

00:04:25.590 --> 00:04:26.580
Ketsu!

00:04:27.430 --> 00:04:28.420
Metsu!

00:04:33.230 --> 00:04:37.230
They're taking almost all your prey.

00:04:37.470 --> 00:04:41.240
No matter how quickly I find them,
if you're too slow to catch them,

00:04:41.280 --> 00:04:42.740
it's no use.

00:04:52.590 --> 00:04:56.250
Now I can win!
What a great plan!

00:04:56.790 --> 00:04:58.620
What are you trying to do?

00:04:58.830 --> 00:05:02.100
To compete with their speed
and accurate techniques,

00:05:02.100 --> 00:05:04.260
I will jump down as soon as
I find the targets!

00:05:04.870 --> 00:05:07.730
It has to be faster
than running after them!

00:05:08.070 --> 00:05:11.100
I can almost see
their surprised looks!

00:05:11.540 --> 00:05:14.170
Madarao. tell me when
you smell anything.

00:05:14.580 --> 00:05:16.510
I'll defeat all the Ayakashi!

00:05:16.780 --> 00:05:17.770
Yeah, yeah.

00:05:19.980 --> 00:05:21.950
Yoshimori. there it is!
At the pool!

00:05:23.650 --> 00:05:24.640
Hey!

00:05:25.690 --> 00:05:26.690
It's huge!

00:05:26.690 --> 00:05:27.680
I'll take care of it!

00:05:28.990 --> 00:05:30.550
Ketsu! Ketsu!

00:05:31.630 --> 00:05:33.150
You're mine! Ketsu!

00:05:34.200 --> 00:05:35.180
Metsu!

00:05:36.030 --> 00:05:37.020
All right!

00:05:37.200 --> 00:05:38.790
H-Hey, Yoshimori! Stop!

00:05:46.740 --> 00:05:47.800
It's so cold!

00:05:51.210 --> 00:05:52.340
Tenketsu!

00:05:56.180 --> 00:05:58.210
What are you doing?
You'll catch a cold.

00:05:58.850 --> 00:06:02.380
You're breathtakingly handsome
like that Yoshi!

00:06:02.590 --> 00:06:03.590
Shut up!

00:06:03.590 --> 00:06:06.250
I'm not so weak that
I'll catch a cold from this!

00:06:21.740 --> 00:06:22.730
Hey!

00:06:22.940 --> 00:06:26.180
How many times do I have to tell you
to stop talking to me during the day?

00:06:26.710 --> 00:06:27.700
W-What is it?

00:06:28.120 --> 00:06:31.050
Oh... I-I mistook you
for someone else. I'm sorry!

00:06:33.790 --> 00:06:37.620
Morning. I just got yelled at.

00:06:40.830 --> 00:06:43.990
That's odd...
I wonder if he overslept.

00:06:47.170 --> 00:06:50.630
38.7 degrees Celsius.
You have a cold all right.

00:06:54.510 --> 00:06:55.600
Yoshimori!

00:06:56.540 --> 00:06:57.810
How long are you going
to sleep in!

00:06:57.810 --> 00:06:59.080
You're missing school!

00:06:59.080 --> 00:07:02.680
F-Father. Yoshimori is sick
and has a fever.

00:07:02.880 --> 00:07:04.680
We should have him
stay home today.

00:07:05.050 --> 00:07:08.250
Grandpa Shige, I keep telling you that
you're not allowed in my room!

00:07:13.430 --> 00:07:17.960
You fool. Your lack of training
caused you to catch a cold!

00:07:18.230 --> 00:07:22.600
I'm truly worried about
your future as the Legitimate Heir!

00:07:22.770 --> 00:07:25.860
Yoshimori, it's best if you
stay home and rest today.

00:07:37.820 --> 00:07:38.810
Aihi-san.

00:07:39.850 --> 00:07:41.520
Is there something
I can help with?

00:07:41.990 --> 00:07:42.980
Nothing right now.

00:07:44.690 --> 00:07:46.990
Oh... Did you finish
the new model?

00:07:47.700 --> 00:07:51.100
No. this is the old one.
I was going to dispose of it.

00:07:51.700 --> 00:07:52.670
Dispose?

00:07:52.670 --> 00:07:53.400
What's wrong?

00:07:53.400 --> 00:07:57.800
Well... If you're going to
throw it away, can I wear it?

00:07:57.910 --> 00:07:59.810
I've always wanted to.

00:07:59.940 --> 00:08:01.000
What are you saying?

00:08:01.080 --> 00:08:04.080
I want to be useful in
the fight for Karasumori.

00:08:04.080 --> 00:08:06.640
I don't want to stay here forever!

00:08:07.010 --> 00:08:08.740
You understand, don't you Aihi-san?

00:08:11.150 --> 00:08:12.350
Only for a little bit though.

00:08:12.790 --> 00:08:13.780
Thank you!

00:08:14.320 --> 00:08:15.480
Just stand right there.

00:08:28.840 --> 00:08:30.360
Awesome! Is this really me?

00:08:30.510 --> 00:08:32.230
It feels like I've been reborn!

00:08:32.710 --> 00:08:33.940
But just in shape only.

00:08:34.210 --> 00:08:36.510
Your powers will be severely limited.

00:08:36.510 --> 00:08:38.240
Are you sure about this?

00:08:38.750 --> 00:08:41.810
You really don't have time
to play dress up using the old models.

00:08:42.520 --> 00:08:43.510
You don't need to worry about it.

00:08:43.720 --> 00:08:44.980
The development is well underway.

00:08:45.050 --> 00:08:46.640
I'm bored.

00:08:46.720 --> 00:08:50.920
We can't go to Karasumori
until the new model is complete.

00:08:51.730 --> 00:08:53.660
I'm fine with
the old model personally.

00:08:54.160 --> 00:08:56.860
Having my powers restrained
is good in my case.

00:08:57.270 --> 00:09:00.170
But this guy is not worth
wearing the human skin.

00:09:00.170 --> 00:09:02.270
I-If I can go to Karasumori...

00:09:02.270 --> 00:09:03.290
I doubt it.

00:09:03.770 --> 00:09:06.140
Don't touch him, Kaguro!
He's my subordinate!

00:09:07.580 --> 00:09:12.480
You want to go to Karasumori?
What can trash like you do?

00:09:14.220 --> 00:09:16.710
I don't feel anything
from you.

00:09:17.290 --> 00:09:18.620
No aesthetics of any kind, nothing.

00:09:19.550 --> 00:09:21.020
Just you watch!
I can do it!

00:09:21.590 --> 00:09:22.960
Wait. Hisui!
Don't do anything stupid!

00:09:22.960 --> 00:09:23.950
Stop!

00:09:25.130 --> 00:09:27.590
Oh, just let him do what he wants.

00:09:27.860 --> 00:09:29.660
He said he wanted to go, didn't he?

00:09:30.000 --> 00:09:32.400
Kaguro, you instigated this!

00:09:32.600 --> 00:09:37.160
Did I? Well, maybe it will
ward off my boredom.

00:09:42.910 --> 00:09:46.850
I'll go to Karasumori!
To Karasumori!

00:09:53.590 --> 00:09:54.890
The dawn of spring,

00:09:54.890 --> 00:09:56.960
when mountain ranges
gradually brighten

00:09:56.960 --> 00:09:58.220
and purple wisps of
clouds drift across.

00:09:58.460 --> 00:09:59.460
Do you understand this?

00:09:59.460 --> 00:10:01.160
Sumimura, don't sleep.

00:10:02.030 --> 00:10:03.060
He's not even here.

00:10:03.060 --> 00:10:05.230
It's become a habit to say that.

00:10:25.450 --> 00:10:28.450
Say... What happened to
Sumimura-kun today?

00:10:28.960 --> 00:10:29.980
I heard he caught a cold.

00:10:30.390 --> 00:10:31.390
Oh.

00:10:31.390 --> 00:10:32.760
I better write this down...

00:10:33.230 --> 00:10:34.730
They say that stupid people
don't catch colds.

00:10:34.730 --> 00:10:35.890
but Sumimura is the exception.

00:10:37.060 --> 00:10:41.300
I always seem to get half-baked
information on him.

00:10:46.940 --> 00:10:48.930
W-What is it?

00:10:49.810 --> 00:10:50.850
Where is he?

00:10:50.850 --> 00:10:52.610
H-He?!

00:10:54.920 --> 00:10:57.120
He means Sumimura-kun?!
That's right!

00:10:57.120 --> 00:10:59.550
Sumimura-kun is stupid
but he caught a cold!

00:11:00.320 --> 00:11:02.850
He's absent today.
I'm sorry.

00:11:11.170 --> 00:11:12.150
What's with him?

00:11:16.400 --> 00:11:19.770
What did he want
with Sumimura-kun?

00:11:23.080 --> 00:11:24.810
Oh. I know!

00:11:25.180 --> 00:11:26.940
Sumimura-kun's older sister!

00:11:28.420 --> 00:11:31.440
Sumimura-kun is out
sick today, right?

00:11:31.690 --> 00:11:33.480
R-Really?

00:11:33.720 --> 00:11:36.050
There's something urgent
I want to ask you!

00:11:36.320 --> 00:11:39.520
S-Sure... If it's not
too complicated...

00:11:40.530 --> 00:11:41.790
So what's wrong?

00:11:42.000 --> 00:11:45.260
Well. there's this
very dangerous person.

00:11:45.430 --> 00:11:46.420
Huh?

00:11:46.670 --> 00:11:49.160
He transferred into
the class next to mine.

00:11:49.200 --> 00:11:53.000
He has spiked hair and he has
the pointed eyes of an animal.

00:11:53.040 --> 00:11:55.200
I get the feeling that he'll beat to death
anyone that goes near him.

00:11:55.240 --> 00:11:58.370
I feel like I'm peering into the face of danger
every time I look into his eyes.

00:11:58.480 --> 00:12:01.310
Anyway, he's very dangerous!

00:12:02.250 --> 00:12:05.310
Wait, are you talking
about Shishio Gen-kun?

00:12:05.650 --> 00:12:07.780
Yes! You know who he is?!

00:12:08.120 --> 00:12:13.390
Well, Gen-kun helps us
with our work. It's okay.

00:12:13.760 --> 00:12:16.200
Oh... really?

00:12:16.430 --> 00:12:20.630
And I'm Yukimura Tokine.
I'm not his sister.

00:12:21.940 --> 00:12:22.930
Huh?!

00:12:23.100 --> 00:12:25.100
You didn't have to be so surprised.

00:12:25.440 --> 00:12:28.970
If you're not his sister,
what are you to him?

00:12:29.310 --> 00:12:31.800
Huh? What am I?

00:12:32.110 --> 00:12:34.210
Ummmm...

00:12:34.420 --> 00:12:39.410
Hmm... What am I?
A coworker, maybe?

00:12:45.630 --> 00:12:47.830
Say. The boy that's sick
is the one

00:12:47.830 --> 00:12:50.090
that waits for you over
there sometimes, right?

00:12:56.500 --> 00:12:57.770
Y-Yeah...

00:12:57.770 --> 00:13:00.470
I knew it. Is that boy
your childhood friend?

00:13:02.110 --> 00:13:04.510
I think he's a bit
more than that.

00:13:04.850 --> 00:13:06.210
You know...

00:13:06.910 --> 00:13:08.680
I think that boy likes you.

00:13:08.950 --> 00:13:09.940
Huh?

00:13:10.380 --> 00:13:13.840
Every time he finds you,
he looks really cute.

00:13:13.890 --> 00:13:15.550
Stop it. He's just a kid.

00:13:15.690 --> 00:13:16.750
Don't be so sure!

00:13:16.920 --> 00:13:19.420
He's not going to stay
a kid forever.

00:13:20.030 --> 00:13:21.650
I guess so.

00:13:21.860 --> 00:13:24.470
My brother used to be
really stupid,

00:13:24.470 --> 00:13:25.490
but he really changed.

00:13:25.930 --> 00:13:27.300
But he's still stupid though.

00:13:34.610 --> 00:13:36.200
I never thought about it like that.

00:13:36.740 --> 00:13:39.080
I assumed that he'd
always be the way he is.

00:13:46.290 --> 00:13:48.310
Don't cry.

00:13:53.860 --> 00:13:57.060
Will there be a day when
he'll stop being a kid?

00:14:02.070 --> 00:14:04.770
Hisui wore a human skin
and went to Karasumori?

00:14:05.140 --> 00:14:06.270
Should we go after him?

00:14:06.270 --> 00:14:08.430
No. This may prove interesting.

00:14:08.940 --> 00:14:13.240
If he uses his powers,
the skin won't fall into human hands.

00:14:13.980 --> 00:14:15.020
Are you sure?

00:14:15.020 --> 00:14:16.680
This is different from what
we discussed in the meeting.

00:14:17.420 --> 00:14:19.510
Just put him on surveillance.

00:14:19.920 --> 00:14:22.220
No harm in obtaining more data.

00:14:26.890 --> 00:14:30.100
Unbelievable!
So even Yoshi gets sick.

00:14:30.100 --> 00:14:31.290
Seems like it.

00:14:31.570 --> 00:14:34.100
Are you going to be all right
without Yoshi, honey?

00:14:34.100 --> 00:14:37.700
Of course I'll be all right.
What are you trying to say?

00:14:37.810 --> 00:14:40.370
No, I just thought that maybe

00:14:40.370 --> 00:14:42.870
you'd feel different without
the usual guys...

00:14:43.710 --> 00:14:45.470
Wait, honey!

00:15:01.100 --> 00:15:03.090
What?! Could this be?

00:15:03.460 --> 00:15:04.760
What's wrong, Hakubi?

00:15:04.830 --> 00:15:06.770
This one's going to be a handful.

00:15:06.800 --> 00:15:07.790
Huh?!

00:15:12.970 --> 00:15:15.600
Now that I am here.
this will be Sumimura's land!

00:15:16.140 --> 00:15:16.940
Huh?

00:15:16.940 --> 00:15:19.000
Well well. if it isn't
the Yukimura girl.

00:15:19.350 --> 00:15:22.440
Though an idiot, that idiot is bedridden
due to a cold.

00:15:23.120 --> 00:15:24.250
Is Yoshimori okay?

00:15:24.250 --> 00:15:25.880
However!

00:15:26.120 --> 00:15:27.780
Now that I am here, you have
nothing to worry about!

00:15:27.860 --> 00:15:29.150
Let us go, Madarao!

00:15:30.260 --> 00:15:31.420
U-Um...

00:15:31.730 --> 00:15:34.630
Shige-boy. He's getting way
too excited for his age.

00:15:34.900 --> 00:15:37.590
Madarao! Doesn't this remind you
of the old days?

00:15:37.730 --> 00:15:38.860
No. it doesn't.

00:15:44.340 --> 00:15:46.330
Madarao. how is Yoshimori?

00:15:46.770 --> 00:15:48.240
Is he making himself useful?

00:15:48.880 --> 00:15:51.280
He's very powerful,

00:15:51.280 --> 00:15:53.440
but he's an idiot and doesn't plan
things ahead of time.

00:15:53.680 --> 00:15:55.650
But you were the same
when you were young.

00:15:56.220 --> 00:15:57.910
Then that means
he's very promising.

00:15:58.190 --> 00:16:01.120
But in terms of stupidity,
he's in a league of his own.

00:16:01.320 --> 00:16:04.760
He would jump in a sea of fire
if he thought he needed to.

00:16:07.900 --> 00:16:08.880
What?

00:16:09.200 --> 00:16:10.200
This is!

00:16:10.200 --> 00:16:11.260
The scent of a human?!

00:16:11.400 --> 00:16:12.390
Yeah!

00:16:12.530 --> 00:16:14.590
Is it really human?
Or could it be?!

00:16:21.140 --> 00:16:23.740
Are you the Kekkaishi
protecting Karasumori?

00:16:24.450 --> 00:16:25.610
This is the Ayakashi?!

00:16:25.710 --> 00:16:27.010
He's no different from a human!

00:16:27.610 --> 00:16:30.280
There's something completely
different inside.

00:16:31.020 --> 00:16:32.990
This thing looks
like human skin.

00:16:33.950 --> 00:16:35.390
So you're with Kokuboro, right?

00:16:36.790 --> 00:16:38.990
Grandfather, please help us out.

00:16:39.830 --> 00:16:41.800
So the old man is also
a Kekkaishi?

00:16:41.800 --> 00:16:42.760
That's right!

00:16:42.760 --> 00:16:46.200
I heard that two young Kekkaishi
were protecting Karasumori.

00:16:46.670 --> 00:16:47.730
You look really old.

00:16:47.940 --> 00:16:49.030
We're different people!

00:16:49.240 --> 00:16:54.870
Oh well. I'll just defeat you all
and absorb the powers of Karasumori!

00:17:04.180 --> 00:17:06.020
Just a regular Ayakashi inside.

00:17:06.350 --> 00:17:10.290
I shall show you the secret arts
of the Sumimuras!

00:17:11.160 --> 00:17:12.350
What's that?

00:17:12.460 --> 00:17:15.260
Secret Arts!
Technique of Never Retiring!

00:17:21.800 --> 00:17:22.830
M-My back!

00:17:23.040 --> 00:17:24.400
Are you all right?!

00:17:24.840 --> 00:17:26.030
I-I can't move!

00:17:26.170 --> 00:17:28.330
Don't scare me like that!

00:17:29.110 --> 00:17:30.510
Watch out! Ketsu!

00:17:36.480 --> 00:17:37.470
I won't let you get away!

00:17:40.050 --> 00:17:42.180
Hakubi. is that the same
Ayakashi as last time?

00:17:42.420 --> 00:17:44.220
The smell of the human skin
is the same.

00:17:44.220 --> 00:17:45.620
but the inside is different!

00:17:46.030 --> 00:17:48.320
Maybe anyone can wear that skin.

00:17:54.440 --> 00:17:56.200
Not bad.

00:18:02.980 --> 00:18:04.070
It regenerated?!

00:18:14.990 --> 00:18:17.120
That one's odd.

00:18:17.560 --> 00:18:18.790
Aren't you going?

00:18:18.890 --> 00:18:20.590
You can destroy that thing.

00:18:20.790 --> 00:18:22.760
If only I could move.

00:18:23.630 --> 00:18:25.620
You can't fool me!

00:18:25.730 --> 00:18:27.400
I know you're lying about
your back hurting.

00:18:27.400 --> 00:18:28.670
What are you talking about?

00:18:28.670 --> 00:18:32.110
Stop playing dumb.
Putting on that stupid show...

00:18:32.740 --> 00:18:35.830
If she must rely on me,
she cannot protect Karasumori.

00:18:36.310 --> 00:18:37.740
Even without Yoshimori.

00:18:37.740 --> 00:18:39.610
they must be able to deal
with this on their own.

00:18:39.680 --> 00:18:42.420
Oh my. You have matured very well.

00:18:42.420 --> 00:18:44.250
This brings a tear to my eye!

00:18:44.250 --> 00:18:45.290
It feels like it was only yesterday

00:18:45.290 --> 00:18:48.090
when you were a snot-nosed brat
with flowing hair.

00:18:48.090 --> 00:18:49.080
Silence!

00:18:49.390 --> 00:18:53.880
But that Ayakashi will be
a difficult one for the Yukimura girl.

00:18:57.260 --> 00:18:58.250
Gen-kun!

00:18:59.770 --> 00:19:00.930
You want to surround me?!

00:19:02.070 --> 00:19:03.060
Ketsu!

00:19:04.670 --> 00:19:05.660
Metsu!

00:19:11.110 --> 00:19:12.100
What?!

00:19:12.310 --> 00:19:14.580
What's wrong?
You out of things to do?!

00:19:14.880 --> 00:19:16.010
What is this guy?

00:19:16.080 --> 00:19:17.080
Dammit!

00:19:17.080 --> 00:19:18.070
Wait!

00:19:18.590 --> 00:19:20.750
It can regenerate as long as
a single piece of it is left.

00:19:21.120 --> 00:19:22.110
There will be no end to it.

00:19:22.160 --> 00:19:24.560
Then how about destroying
all the pieces

00:19:24.560 --> 00:19:26.460
by creating a large Kekkai,
like he usually does.

00:19:27.330 --> 00:19:32.590
A large Kekkai may destroy it.
But I can't...

00:19:32.830 --> 00:19:34.230
Hurry up and come on!

00:19:35.340 --> 00:19:37.390
I have to do things my own way!

00:19:39.170 --> 00:19:41.370
I have to surround every
single piece in an instant!

00:19:45.380 --> 00:19:46.370
Ketsu!

00:19:52.290 --> 00:19:54.310
Ketsu! Ketsu! Ketsu!

00:19:54.920 --> 00:19:59.590
Ketsu! Ketsu! Ketsu! Ketsu!

00:20:00.260 --> 00:20:01.250
Ketsu!

00:20:07.500 --> 00:20:08.490
Did I do it?

00:20:09.370 --> 00:20:10.360
What?!

00:20:10.470 --> 00:20:11.460
No...

00:20:11.610 --> 00:20:13.200
S-Stop!

00:20:14.840 --> 00:20:15.830
Metsu!

00:20:22.720 --> 00:20:23.740
Tenketsu!

00:20:32.460 --> 00:20:35.390
Not bad. But...

00:20:39.270 --> 00:20:40.670
That was a lot of trouble.

00:20:47.240 --> 00:20:48.270
Honey!

00:20:49.510 --> 00:20:51.410
Playtime's over!

00:20:53.250 --> 00:20:54.270
It can't be!

00:20:54.820 --> 00:20:55.920
It transformed!

00:20:55.920 --> 00:20:56.910
Ketsu!

00:21:00.190 --> 00:21:02.020
What is this?!

00:21:07.060 --> 00:21:08.080
Yoshimori.

00:21:08.330 --> 00:21:11.260
Are you all right... Tokine?

00:21:12.670 --> 00:21:13.500
Yeah...

00:21:13.500 --> 00:21:15.640
Kekkaishi... That was a cheap shot!

00:21:15.640 --> 00:21:16.660
Metsu!

00:21:20.770 --> 00:21:21.760
Here.

00:21:25.580 --> 00:21:29.410
My foot won't come loose!

00:21:30.080 --> 00:21:31.410
Don't cry.

00:21:33.750 --> 00:21:36.750
It's all right.
I'm here to help you.

00:21:37.060 --> 00:21:38.520
Now give me your hand.

00:21:40.890 --> 00:21:41.880
Thanks.

00:21:48.970 --> 00:21:50.700
It's a good thing I came.

00:21:51.740 --> 00:21:52.730
Yeah...

00:21:53.970 --> 00:21:56.170
I used to protect you.

00:21:56.980 --> 00:21:59.500
I guess you won't
stay a kid forever.

00:21:59.950 --> 00:22:01.780
What are you doing?!

00:22:02.020 --> 00:22:03.880
What are YOU doing, Grandpa Shige?

00:22:04.020 --> 00:22:06.880
How dare you take away
my spotlight!

00:22:07.020 --> 00:22:10.680
Spotlight?! You would've been in
big trouble if it weren't for me!

00:22:11.020 --> 00:22:12.050
No. I wouldn't!

00:22:12.290 --> 00:22:13.460
Yes, you would!

00:22:13.460 --> 00:22:14.490
No. I wouldn't!

00:22:14.490 --> 00:22:19.260
What?! Fine!
Take some of my snot attack!

00:22:19.770 --> 00:22:20.790
Ketsu!

00:22:21.440 --> 00:22:23.530
He's a kid after all...

00:22:25.040 --> 00:22:28.440
Why you-! Yoshimori!

00:22:28.440 --> 00:22:30.380
Snot attack!

00:22:46.330 --> 00:22:50.020
With a look on your face that says
"I'm doing this for you"

00:22:50.060 --> 00:22:53.290
While being enthusiastic
across the table

00:22:53.430 --> 00:22:57.460
Why do you only tell me
dark predictions?

00:22:57.600 --> 00:23:01.060
It's a meaningless
use of language.

00:23:01.310 --> 00:23:04.870
Trying to avoid an emergency
nothing's gonna happen

00:23:05.010 --> 00:23:08.850
I can't learn anything
(What's going on?)

00:23:08.880 --> 00:23:12.910
You're not bearing
the brunt of my future

00:23:12.950 --> 00:23:16.180
I am it's common sense

00:23:16.220 --> 00:23:20.520
I can't go anywhere
if I'm always weak

00:23:20.560 --> 00:23:26.500
Train me so hard until I cry

00:23:28.140 --> 00:23:32.830
If you're gonna complain that
tough times are heading our way

00:23:32.870 --> 00:23:34.810
(If that's true)

00:23:34.840 --> 00:23:39.510
Please don't baby me
any more than you need to

00:23:39.650 --> 00:23:42.950
Please Please Please

00:23:42.980 --> 00:23:47.150
Even if I bleed
I'll get a hold of the wisdom

00:23:47.190 --> 00:23:50.490
To stand firm in
this unstable world

00:23:50.520 --> 00:23:54.760
You watch from far away

00:23:54.800 --> 00:24:00.760
It's strange that
I want to hold you

00:24:01.570 --> 00:24:02.870
Hey Hey
